<title>FRANCE: France's Total says Angola well could be very big.</title>
<headline>France's Total says Angola well could be very big.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of French oil group Total, Thierry Desmarest, said on Wednesday he reckoned that an Angolan block 14 well could be very big.</p>
<p>&quot;We've had really positive results. There's a strong chance that it's a really big well,&quot; he told a shareholders meeting.</p>
<p>He added that 500 million barrels amounted to a really big oil deposit by industry standards.</p>
<p>Total has 20 percent of the block, while U.S. group Chevron has 31 percent and is operator.</p>
</text>
